<DocsLayout
  title="CLI & flags reference"
  description="The complete niu command-line reference: basic invocations and every flag (-c/-C/--encoded-command/--cwd-state/--completion-probe), Windows Terminal integration, self-update, all plugin subcommands, skill/wpm quick reference, the GNU bash-compatible surface, and configuration environment variables. Source: live niu --help output."
