  <section>
    <h2 id="bash-compat">GNU bash-compatible surface</h2>
    <p>
      The options below are <strong>not listed in <code>niu --help</code> but all supported</strong> —
      the rubash engine aligns with GNU Bash 5.3 semantics, so GNU's invocation surface carries over:
    </p>
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table class="cli-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Surface</th><th>Content</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><code>GNU long options</code></td>
            <td>
              <code>--debug</code> <code>--debugger</code> <code>--dump-po-strings</code>{' '}
              <code>--dump-strings</code> <code>--help</code> <code>--init-file</code>{' '}
              <code>--login</code> <code>--noediting</code> <code>--noprofile</code>{' '}
              <code>--norc</code> <code>--posix</code> <code>--pretty-print</code>{' '}
              <code>--rcfile</code> <code>--restricted</code> <code>--verbose</code>{' '}
              <code>--version</code>
            </td>
            <td>One-to-one with the 16 long options listed by bash --help.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>Invocation combos (startup only)</code></td>
            <td><code>-i -l -r -s -D</code> · <code>-c command</code> · <code>-O shopt_option</code></td>
            <td>Interactive / login / restricted / read stdin / echo per line / set a shopt.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>set option surface</code></td>
            <td><code>-abefhkmnptuvxBCEHPT</code> · <code>-o option</code></td>
            <td>The same set of single-letter options and -o names as GNU (<code>niu -c 'help set'</code> lists them all).</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>Builtin help</code></td>
            <td><code>niu -c 'help set'</code> · <code>niu -c help</code></td>
            <td>set option descriptions and the builtin list — GNU's own entry points.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>rc selection</code></td>
            <td><code>--rcfile</code> / <code>--init-file</code></td>
            <td>Point at an alternative startup file.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="src-line">Source: cross-checked against <code>bash --help</code> (same-machine GNU Bash 5.3.0 output); compatibility is governed by the <a href="/en/docs/compatibility/">83/83 suite ledger</a>.</p>
  </section>

